# Copy to .env. Keys for the providers named in models.yaml go here; the file
# is never committed and never copied into the image. A local model server
# needs none of this.
#
# The server needs an owner key of at least 32 characters. It's the only way
# in, so keep it secret. To make one: openssl rand -hex 32
# EXCOGITATE_OWNER_KEY=
#
# EXCOGITATE_CLOUD_API_KEY=
